CAS number: 013397-24-5; 
Formula: CaSO4 * 2 H2O; 
Synonyms: calcium sulfate dihydrate (has CAS 10101-41-4), natural gypsum (has CAS 13397-24-5), alabaster, selenite; 
UUID: 6fc9f5b2-f1c1-43e4-8b2c-8c906fe41957
energy for dismantling, particulate matter emissions from dismantling and handling, 
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in Switzerland in late 1990ies
Technology: Building demolition with skid-steer loaders. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: waste-specific calculation based on literature data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6fc9f5b2-f1c1-43e4-8b2c-8c906fe41957.xml</text>
